  data: {
    LLM: "Always steal a bundle if possible. It swings the score massively. If you have two cards of the same rank, play one to capture/steal? No, usually you only play one. If you have a match for a table card and a match for a bundle, take the bundle.\n\nBaiting: If you have two 8s and there's an 8 on the table, you might wait to capture if you think someone else will capture it, letting you steal their bundle next turn? Risky.\n\nTracking: Remember what opponents captured. If they stole a bundle with a King on top, the King is now covered by your stealing card (e.g., a 5). The King is buried.",
